(text "Expander outputs power up as inputs; 10 k pull-downs hold coils, stepper power and enables off until firmware drives them." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3ef2b68f-d9b8-45a3-8c39-b5975df37b7d))
(text "Stepper enable polarity is set in firmware after bench check 3. Any stepper alarm drops all motors (firmware)." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b87ff2f0-82e8-4a90-9b94-6476ca3581d5))
(text "E-stop contact 1 sits in series with the watchdog-gated coil supply (J pins 1-2); contact 2 reports status (pins 3-4)." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 301af729-9a7b-4e95-b84b-ec497d1ac5ea))
(text "Heartbeat watchdog: 74HCT123 retriggered by GPIO46. Q stays high while pulses arrive (period < ~0.2 s); otherwise the coil supply drops." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0dfe057b-6d8f-467b-9c93-6b3fd60f250d))
